@startuml mo_senate
title mo_senate: MO Senate daily journals
start
:for each year in the lookback window:
GET senate.mo.gov/journallist/?SelectedYear=YYYY
(current year daily, past years monthly);
:owned journal PDFs -> pdfplumber text;
:strip running page headers
("Journal of the Senate 118", day lines);
:find each "YEAS—Senators ... Vacancies—" block
(bounded to 2,500 chars so a block missing "Vacancies"
can't swallow the rest of the journal);
:one row per (vote block, category, senator token)
+ the sentence that introduced the vote;
note right
  Duplicate surnames carry a district:
  "Brown (16)" (2025+) or "Brown (16th Dist.)" (older),
  both normalised to "Brown (16)".
end note
:mo_senate_journals, mo_senate_votes;
stop
@enduml
